<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Control Room Furniture &amp; Consoles</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Control rooms we have built</h2><p>Three control rooms for one industrial power plant: operator console panels supplied in 2010, a plant control room built in 2011, and a central control room built in 2015. All three are in continuous operation.</p>
